---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="The story behind It's All About Mind.">

  <div class="about-grid">

    <div class="about-text">
      <div class="hero-tag" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our Story</div>
      <h1>The mind is where<br/><em style="color:var(--accent);font-style:italic;">everything begins</em></h1>

      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem;">I started this space because I've seen the mind's power firsthand. The way a single thought can shift your entire reality. The way intention, when practiced consistently, quietly reshapes what you attract and how you experience life.</p>

      <p>This isn't about blind positivity or ignoring real challenges. It's about understanding — through philosophy, science, and lived experience — how consciousness works, and how to work with it rather than against it.</p>

      <p>Here you'll find practical insights on meditation, law of attraction, stoicism, and mindset that you can actually use. No fluff, no guru worship. Just honest exploration of what it means to live more intentionally.</p>

      <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-top:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/blog" class="btn">Read the Blog</a>
        <a href="/resources" class="btn btn-ghost">Explore Resources</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-values">
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--text-muted);">What we believe</h3>

      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>🧠 Mind First</h4>
        <p>Every external reality starts as an internal state. Understanding your mind is the highest leverage point.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>🌿 Grounded Spirituality</h4>
        <p>Spiritual practice should make you more present and effective in the real world, not less.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>📚 Wisdom Over Hype</h4>
        <p>We draw from ancient philosophy, modern psychology, and lived experience — not trends.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>✨ Practice Over Theory</h4>
        <p>Reading is a start. But transformation only happens through consistent, daily practice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Quote -->
  <section class="quote-section">
    <blockquote>"Change your thoughts and you change your world."</blockquote>
    <cite>— Norman Vincent Peale</cite>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
